      "content": "it's just hard to find the energy to \"find a new place\" when there's nothing left to connect to. everything feels hollow. like i'm just watching a movie of a life i'm not even a part of anymore. it doesn't feel like i'm just \"out of sync\"... it feels like my time has naturally just run out.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
